WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.310
Have you ever thought about standing for a Community Board?

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:06.980
It’s a great way to serve your community

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:11.990
and with the local body elections coming up, we’re fishing for new candidates.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.900
So what’s involved?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:20.360
If elected – the decisions and recommendations
you’ll make, will benefit your local community.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.740
You’ll attend monthly meetings, community
events

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:29.760
and may be involved with various community groups, depending on your interests and availability.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:34.240
You could expect to spend roughly three to five hours a week in the role.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.320
So make a difference, nominations are open now.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:46.440
Grab the form or find out more at waimakariri.govt.nz/vote2019

